        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f559fd89-0c3f-4e8c-aa84-a9de98b0f9d3).Image",
        "Description": "Rico Delgado&apos;s employees have been slacking off lately. Time theft is still theft, and you don&apos;t steal from the Cartel. Rico came up with a history-inspired solution. All his 60 workers were gathered and had to draw numbers. Whoever drew the 6 unlucky numbers were to be executed the next day by a hitman. Except one mansion guard did not show up at all and was sentenced to death by default. That&apos;s where you come into play, 47. Slay the idle and slothful in the name of dilligence and justice.",
